 "name_en": "Asset Accounting (UPA) (6DR)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Asset Accounting (UPA) (6DR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Asset accounting is a subsidiary ledger of the general ledger and is used to manage and document fixed asset transactions in detail. In general ledger accounting, you update depreciation and changes to asset balance sheet values in asset accounting. You make various account assignments to cost accounting for these transactions. Because of the integration in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>, Asset Accounting (FI-AA) transfers data directly to and from other <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> components such as Financial Accounting (FI) components.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create asset master</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Acquire assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Retire assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Valuate assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform month-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform year-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Purchase asset from purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create legacy assets</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get a transparent view of asset acquisition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide efficient automated processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate values for depreciation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Record depreciation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>资产会计 (UPA) (6DR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">资产会计是总账的明细分类账，用于管理和详细记录固定资产交易。在总账会计中，更新资产会计中的折旧和对资产负债表值的更改。针对这些交易向成本会计进行各种科目分配。由于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的集成，资产会计 (FI-AA) 直接与其他 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 组件（例如财务会计 (FI) 组件）传输数据。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建资产主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">报废资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评估资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行月末关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行年终关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从采购订单采购资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建历史资产</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio141be5fe13d64321a7a27a81a72966cd__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">获取资产购置的透明视图</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提供高效的自动化处理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计算折旧值</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">记录折旧</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
